OL,3,GNEWSABin bag appeal urging campers to
OL,4,Aleave no trace
OL,5,
OL,6,FBranded bin liners are being handed out
OL,7,Fin the Lake District to tackle
OL,8,Firresponsible fly camping and
OL,9,Flittering.
OL,11,FThe sleeves urge people to "leave no
OL,12,Ftrace, just good vibes" and have a QR
OL,13,Fcode linking to a directory of over 100
OL,14,F"unreal campsites", billed as ideal
OL,15,Falternatives to informal camping spots.
OL,17,FIn addition, Lake District National
OL,18,FPark Authority (LDNPA) rangers are
OL,19,Fengaging with groups found to be
OL,20,Fcamping irresponsibly, giving them
OL,21,Ftools to clean up any litter or mess.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
